  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6d917413b28cd924e9620d87e27f790f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  runOnStart: 0
  speakerName: Assistant
  steps:
  - text: Excellent.
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onStepEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    autoDelay: 0
  - text: Even something as small as a thread can become critical evidence.
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onStepEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    autoDelay: 0
  - text: Sometimes criminals leave marks when breaking into buildings.
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onStepEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    autoDelay: 0
  - text: These are called tool marks.
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onStepEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    autoDelay: 0
  - text: Each tool leaves unique patterns.
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onStepEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    autoDelay: 0
  - text: By measuring these marks, investigators can identify the tool used.
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onStepEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1573593914}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: LabManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: ForensicsTraining_10
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
